OL,3,GNEWSABaker thought Call of Duty cake   
OL,4,Acall was a prank                       
OL,6,FWhen a cake maker received a call from 
OL,7,FCalifornia asking if she could make a  
OL,8,Fcake to mark the 20th anniversary of   
OL,9,Fthe Call of Duty video game, she       
OL,10,Fthought it was a joke.                 
OL,12,FBut it proved to be a genuine call from
OL,13,Fthe tech firm Activision, and since    
OL,14,Fthen her cakes have become more and    
OL,15,Fmore popular in the gaming world.      
OL,17,FThe American company went on to order  
OL,18,Fanother similar cake to mark the       
OL,19,Frelease of a new version of the Call of
OL,20,FDuty game, and this week an IT firm    
OL,21,Fordered a cake to celebrate the launch 
OL,22,Fof Grand Theft Auto 6.                 
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
